      <para>This .NET enum represents the <c>COMMAND_PARAMETER_VALUE_STOP_MODE_*</c> constants in <see cref="T:Android.Media.TV.Interactive.TvInteractiveAppService" />. The modes request a blank screen or a frozen video frame.</para>
      <para>See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/media/tv/interactive/TvInteractiveAppService#COMMAND_PARAMETER_KEY_STOP_MODE">Android stop mode reference</a></format>.</para>
